## 23. Source-defined function inventory

| Shared controller | Responsibilities and target adaptation |
| --- | --- |
| Components | Initialize Bootstrap popovers/tooltips/offcanvas/toasts; fullscreen toggle; nonempty search dropdown; counter animation. Initialize only mounted components and clean up on unmount. |
| FormValidation | Listen to submit, checkValidity, prevent invalid submission and add was-validated. Keep server validation. |
| FormAdvanced | Inputmask and Choices configuration from data attributes: search, grouping, removal, limits, sorting, duplicate prevention and disabled state. |
| Portlet | Remove a presentation card or display temporary reload overlay. Real refresh follows a query lifecycle, not a randomized timer. |
| Code | ClipboardJS copy with temporary Copied caption; Prism normalization; Gumshoe active docs navigation. These are demo documentation features, not business requirements. |
| Dragula | Drag between declared container IDs with an optional handle class. Target reordering must persist through its own API when required. |
| SwiperSlider | Default/navigation/pagination/scrollbar/vertical/mousewheel/effect/responsive showcase variants, mostly loop and 2500ms autoplay. |
| ToastNotification | Toastify options from data attributes: text, gravity, position, semantic class, duration, close and offset; stop on focus. |
| ThemeLayout | URL-aware menu activation, peer collapse management, active-item scrolling, theme/topbar/menu controls, menu size toggle, backdrop, reset, resize and session preferences. |

### Demo-only behavior to replace

Product list pagination links and many CRUD actions are static placeholders. Search dropdown visibility is not a search service. A card refresh timer is not an analytics query. Calendar/chat/cart/invoice page initializers are client examples, not evidence of durable storage or permissions. Form validation styling is not server validation. Role checkboxes are not authorization. Use real target contracts for each.

